{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/3283e785ab6e5acad44bc1502b051e79.poster.avif?t=1765824567\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/3283e785ab6e5acad44bc1502b051e79.webm?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An excavation under the Great Pyramid of Egypt which resulted in the finding of gigantic pillars beneath it has been stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial Stones Research, the company behind the excavation, has announced a lack of resources as the reason for stopping the excavation, while local reports and authorities claim something terrible happened down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Alex, a young explorer and freelance reporter who wants to make a name for himself and goes to the excavation site to reveal what happened there. But is Alex ready for what is down there?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay :\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your night vision to find your path in the dark halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/47f8298941dded070953bcba32193cd8.poster.avif?t=1765824567\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/47f8298941dded070953bcba32193cd8.webm?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/47f8298941dded070953bcba32193cd8.mp4?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find batteries to power your camera's night vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/eaa35d999258fdf264e1f2174b541110.poster.avif?t=1765824567\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/eaa35d999258fdf264e1f2174b541110.webm?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/eaa35d999258fdf264e1f2174b541110.mp4?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find reports and letters left by the research team to understand what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/d58c937c12620220ec6aa963f695ea6a.poster.avif?t=1765824567\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/d58c937c12620220ec6aa963f695ea6a.webm?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/d58c937c12620220ec6aa963f695ea6a.mp4?t=1765824567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade Mummies and run for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043280/extras/a4a761cc1631d4aee4fb8fa4617d3675.poster.avif?t=1765824567\" width=568 